# Pool & Spa Command Center — Architecture

## Where things go

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Dashboard route | `src/app/(dashboard)/<feature>/page.tsx` |
| Sidebar nav entry | `src/lib/navigation.ts` (`mainNavItems`) |
| Feature screen / forms | `src/components/<feature>/` (`*-page.tsx`, `*-form-dialog.tsx`) |
| Cross-feature UI | `src/components/shared/` |
| shadcn primitives | `src/components/ui/` (add via CLI, do not hand-roll) |
| Layout / auth chrome | `src/components/layout/`, `src/components/auth/` |
| Data access | `src/lib/data/` via `getDataProvider()` / `useAsyncData()` |
| Amplify schema | `amplify/data/resource.ts` |
| Chemistry / dosing logic | `src/lib/chemistry/` |
| Form validation | `src/lib/validations/<entity>.ts` |
| Onboarding | `src/app/(setup)/` + `src/components/setup/` + `src/lib/setup/` |
| Env / data mode | `src/lib/config/` |
| Amplify client config | `src/lib/amplify/` |
| API probes | `src/app/api/<name>/route.ts` |
| Route protection | `src/middleware.ts` |

## Non-negotiable rules

- UI never calls Amplify or mock stores directly — use the DataProvider abstraction.
- Amplify schema is source of truth for cloud; mock provider mirrors it for local dev.
- Do not edit `amplify_outputs.json` by hand; run `pnpm sandbox` after schema changes.

## Dev workflow

- UI work: `pnpm dev:local` (or `pnpm dev:local:bypass` to skip auth)
- Schema / auth integration: `pnpm sandbox` + `pnpm dev:auth`

## Adding a dashboard feature

1. Add route: `src/app/(dashboard)/<slug>/page.tsx` (thin shell → feature `*-page.tsx`)
2. Add nav item in `src/lib/navigation.ts`
3. Create `src/components/<feature>/<feature>-page.tsx`
4. Add forms/dialogs and Zod schema in `src/lib/validations/` if needed
5. Use `useAsyncData` + DataProvider for data; chemistry logic in `src/lib/chemistry/`

## Adding a new entity (CRUD)

1. Model in `amplify/data/resource.ts` with `allow.owner()`
2. Types in `src/lib/data/types.ts`
3. Methods in `src/lib/data/provider.ts`
4. Amplify CRUD in `src/lib/data/amplify/provider.ts` + mappers
5. Mock CRUD in `src/lib/data/mock/provider.ts` (+ seed if needed)
6. Zod schema in `src/lib/validations/` if user-facing forms exist
7. Deploy: `pnpm sandbox`, then verify with `pnpm dev:auth`
